.DS_Store
build/
captures/
.externalNativeBuild
.cxx
*.apk
*.aab
# Signing material. *.jks matters most: it is what keytool and Android Studio name a
# keystore by default, so without it the release key lands in the first `git add .` — on a
# public repo. keystore.properties holds its passwords.
*.keystore
*.jks
!debug.keystore
keystore.properties
*.p12
*.pepk
*.der

# Regenerate with: python tools/generate_launcher_icons.py --preview
tools/icon-preview.png
# Regenerate with: python tools/generate_pro_badge.py --preview
tools/pro-badge-preview.png
# Regenerate with: python tools/generate_achievement_icons.py --preview
tools/achievements-preview.png
# Regenerate with: python tools/generate_stat_icons.py --preview
tools/stat-icons-preview.png
# Regenerate with: python tools/generate_social_cards.py --preview
tools/social-preview.png
# Regenerate with: python tools/generate_zepp_assets.py --preview
tools/zepp-preview.png
# Regenerate with: python tools/generate_zepp_settings_assets.py --preview
tools/zepp-settings-preview.png
tools/__pycache__/

# The Game Stats upload bundle: a zip of files that are themselves committed beside it.
# Regenerate with: python tools/build_game_stats_zip.py
assets/game-stats/GameStats.zip
# ...and wherever it has been unpacked to look inside. Not a source of anything: unpacked
# copies go stale the moment the zip is rebuilt, and one already had.
assets/game-stats/GameStats/

# Downloaded OAuth client JSON and anything else handed to us out of band.
secrets/

# The Zepp OS build has no BuildConfig, so the two Supabase values have to be a module the
# watch app can import. Generated by tools/sync_zepp_secrets.py from local.properties, and
# kept out of git for the same reason local.properties is.
#
# Deliberately here rather than in zeppos/.gitignore: `zeus dev` rewrites that file with its
# own defaults on every run — silently, and on a *watch* run, so it happens minutes after
# anyone last looked at it. A rule that protects a key cannot live somewhere a build tool
# resets.
zeppos/shared/secrets.js
zeppos/node_modules/
zeppos/dist/

# Supabase CLI writes resolved credentials here.
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/
.env
.env.local
